00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:03.000
A woman's career is shorter, the kind
of acts that a women has to do

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:05.480
in pornography
to collect the big bucks.

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:09.720
Like, you are going age out of
